这是我们现在的日志追踪代码，照着网上文章写的，帮我看看有没有问题：
@Around("@annotation(org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.GetMapping) || @annotation(org.springframework.web.bind.annotation.PostMapping)")
public Object injectLogId(ProceedingJoinPoint pjp) throws Throwable {
  String logId = httpServletRequest.getHeader("logId");
  logId = StringUtils.isNotBlank(logId) ? (logId + "_") : "" + UUID.randomUUID().toString();
  MDC.put("logId", logId);
  try { return pjp.proceed(); } finally { MDC.remove("logId"); }
}
装饰器里是 logId += "_" + Thread.currentThread().getName(); finally 里 MDC.clear()，线程池拒绝策略是 CallerRunsPolicy。
